---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  lang="en" 
  title="NACUAA Northern California — San Francisco Chapter Founding Ceremony" 
  description="On the eve of the Double Ninth Festival (Saturday, October 17, 2026 at 6:00 PM PDT), NACUAA Northern California officially launches its San Francisco Chapter. Founding Ceremony will take place at California Science and Technology University (CSTU) in Milpitas, CA. Free parking available. RSVP: https://luma.com/fuakh3da." 
  path="/en/posts/2026-10-17-nacuaa-san-francisco-chapter-founding-ceremony/"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to News & Events</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2 flex-wrap gap-y-1">
          <time datetime="2026-10-15">October 15, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>Ceremony: Saturday, Oct 17 · 6:00 PM PDT</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20 font-semibold">Special Announcement</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight heading-font">
          🎉 NACUAA Northern California — San Francisco Chapter Founding Ceremony
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg">
          Eve of Double Ninth Festival · Bing-Wu Lunar Year · Celebrating at California Science and Technology University (CSTU)
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Poem Banner Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950/60 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/60 border border-purple-500/40 shadow-2xl text-center space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-400 font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-feather-pointed"></i>
          <span>Ceremonial Dedication</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-feather-pointed"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-purple-100 italic leading-relaxed space-y-1 py-1">
          <p>“Autumn coolness graces San Francisco Bay as North American alumni gather together.</p>
          <p>From Silicon Valley, North Carolina to Washington, sister chapters embark on the voyage together.</p>
          <p>On the eighth night of the ninth lunar month in the Bing-Wu year, CSTU's lights illuminate the distance.</p>
          <p>Ascending tomorrow to watch the morning sunrise, tonight's spark weaves a splendid chapter.”</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Event Time & Venue Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950/40 via-slate-900 to-blue-950/40 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-purple-400"></i>
            <span>Schedule & Venue</span>
          </h3>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block font-medium">Pacific Time (PDT)</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mt-1 block">Sat, Oct 17 · 6:00 PM</span>
              <span class="text-purple-400 text-[11px] block mt-0.5">Founding Ceremony Starts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block font-medium">Eastern Time (EDT)</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mt-1 block">Sat, Oct 17 · 9:00 PM</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] block mt-0.5">East Coast Synchronous</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block font-medium">Beijing Time (CST)</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mt-1 block">Sun, Oct 18 · 9:00 AM</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] block mt-0.5">Next Morning</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-2 pt-1 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-amber-400 mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <span class="text-white font-semibold block text-sm">Venue: California Science and Technology University (CSTU)</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 mt-0.5 block">1601 McCarthy Blvd, Milpitas, CA 95035</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-square-parking text-emerald-400 mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <span class="text-white font-semibold block text-sm">Parking: Ample Free Campus Parking</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 mt-0.5 block">The CSTU campus offers extensive complimentary parking for all event attendees.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="https://luma.com/fuakh3da" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xl flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i>
            <span>Register on Luma</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://sf.nacuaa.ai/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-5 py-3.5 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all border border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i>
            <span>San Francisco Chapter Website</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Event Poster / Cover -->
      <div class="my-8 text-center">
        <img 
          src="/images/2026-10-17-nacuaa-sf-founding-cover.jpg" 
          alt="NACUAA SF Chapter Founding Ceremony Poster" 
          class="w-full mx-auto rounded-3xl border border-purple-500/30 shadow-2xl" 
        />
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3">CSTU Campus, Milpitas · Saturday, Oct 17, 2026 6:00 PM PDT</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Narrative Content Body -->
      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          On the eve of the traditional Double Ninth Festival, the North American Chinese University Alumni Alliance (NACUAA) marks a significant new milestone: <strong>the official founding of the NACUAA Northern California — San Francisco Chapter!</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          As a global nexus of technology, venture capital, and academic distinction, the San Francisco Bay Area is home to thousands of Chinese university alumni. The establishment of the San Francisco Chapter deepens the alliance's presence in Northern California, offering dedicated resources for tech innovation, career growth, entrepreneurship mentorship, and vibrant community activities.
        </p>

        <!-- Sister Chapters & Partners Matrix -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired text-purple-400"></i>
            <span>Jointly Supported by Sister Chapters & Strategic Partners</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
            The founding ceremony is proudly co-supported by NACUAA sister chapters and strategic academic organizations across the United States:
          </p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm block">Northern California Chapter (Parent Chapter)</span>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Overseeing the regional network and club matrix across Northern California (<a href="https://norcal.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-purple-400 underline">norcal.nacuaa.ai</a>).
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm block">Silicon Valley Chapter (Sister Chapter)</span>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Rooted in South Bay's tech capital, partnering closely with SF to form a cohesive Bay Area bridge (<a href="https://sv.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 underline">sv.nacuaa.ai</a>).
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm block">Washington State Chapter (Sister Chapter)</span>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Anchored in the Greater Seattle area, connecting Pacific Northwest tech alumni (<a href="https://wa.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-400 underline">wa.nacuaa.ai</a>).
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <span class="text-pink-400 font-bold text-sm block">Greater Washington DC Chapter (Sister Chapter)</span>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Representing alumni leaders across policy, science, international trade, and finance (<a href="https://dc.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-pink-400 underline">dc.nacuaa.ai</a>).
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm block">North Carolina Chapter (Sister Chapter)</span>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Serving the Research Triangle Park (RTP) biotech and research communities (<a href="https://nc.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 underline">nc.nacuaa.ai</a>).
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm block">Strategic Partners</span>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina (<a href="https://zjuaanc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 underline">zjuaanc.org</a>) and VI AI Foundation (<a href="https://viaifoundation.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 underline">viaifoundation.org</a>).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RSVP Callout -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-purple-950/20 border border-purple-500/30 space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bell text-purple-400"></i>
            <span>Join Us</span>
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            We cordially invite all alumni, tech leaders, scholars, and community friends to join us at California Science and Technology University to celebrate this exciting new chapter.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="https://luma.com/fuakh3da" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-medium text-sm transition-colors">
              <span>Register on Luma</span>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs"></i>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
